WEBVTT

00:09:57.222 --> 00:10:01.370
it's that a country shows strength

00:10:02.522 --> 00:10:04.839
through compassion and pragmatism,

00:10:04.863 --> 00:10:06.770
not through force and through fear.

00:10:07.448 --> 00:10:13.441
(Applause)

00:10:17.139 --> 00:10:21.305
These stories of the Hassenfelds
and my relatives and your relatives

00:10:21.329 --> 00:10:23.879
are still happening today;
they're all the same.

00:10:25.269 --> 00:10:28.546
A country is strong
when it says to the refugee,

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:31.767
not, "Go away," but,